import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 255 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | The Wall of Wushuang Academy: Class Solidification Inside and Outside the Academy","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 255 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | The Wall of Wushuang Academy: Class Solidification Inside and Outside the Academy","no":255,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Wushuang Academy","Class Solidification","Education Monopoly","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["37-Symbiotic Education System","43-Education Guarantee Law","08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0255_模块2-唐罗-无双学院之墙篇.md","filePath":"en/0255_模块2-唐罗-无双学院之墙篇.md"}'),n={name:"en/0255_模块2-唐罗-无双学院之墙篇.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,u,c){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-255-tang-luo-decomposition-the-wall-of-wushuang-academy-class-solidification-inside-and-outside-the-academy" tabindex="-1">Entry 255 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | The Wall of Wushuang Academy: Class Solidification Inside and Outside the Academy <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-255-tang-luo-decomposition-the-wall-of-wushuang-academy-class-solidification-inside-and-outside-the-academy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 255 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | The Wall of Wushuang Academy: Class Solidification Inside and Outside the Academy&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 5)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-tearing-down-one-wall-building-another" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Tearing down one wall, building another <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-tearing-down-one-wall-building-another" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Tearing down one wall, building another&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings to have equal evolution qualification; the law-first axiom requires law first. Tang Luo rebuilt Wushuang Academy with the original intention of tearing down aristocratic families&#39; monopoly on education — but once a new academy becomes the sole cultivation entry, it itself becomes a new wall. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core: the education entry cannot rest on one school, one principal. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Single-campus waste</strong>: Wushuang Academy concentrates the best teachers, methods, resources in one place. World talents must travel a thousand li to attend — travel cost, quota screening, the talent waste of those who fail admission, all borne by civilization</li><li><strong>Admission as stratification</strong>: the academy&#39;s selection mechanism itself manufactures new classes. Admitted enter the fast track, failures return to their original tracks — under universal benefit&#39;s halo, the silent majority who &quot;cannot get in&quot; are ignored</li><li><strong>Curriculum tier waste</strong>: courses inside the academy are still allocated high-tier resources by &quot;whom Tang Luo has taken a fancy to.&quot; Under the same roof, class revives in the form of another class schedule</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste&#39;s essence: Tang Luo used one academy to concentrate old aristocratic families&#39; dispersed monopoly into one school&#39;s centralized monopoly. <strong>Smashed the aristocrats, fattened the top students.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Entry narrowing</strong>: Wushuang Academy quotas are limited, while the cultivation population explodes due to popularization. Thousands of troops cross a single-log bridge; the elite on this side and the &quot;failures&quot; on the other form a new binary opposition</li><li><strong>Principal leaves, tea cools</strong>: the academy was personally founded by Tang Luo; school rules, ethos, teachers all are his personality projection. He retires, who succeeds? Can the successor maintain his standards? — this is all &quot;principal-star system&quot; schools&#39; destiny</li><li><strong>Knowledge vacuum outside school</strong>: outside the academy, private self-learners who cannot get orthodox courses sprout wild methods. Demonic deviation, pseudo-methods rampant, evil cultivators proliferating are precisely the byproducts of &quot;orthodoxy in one place only&quot;</li></ol><p>Regression form: the academy runs better and better, outside the academy grows wilder and wilder; civilization as a whole is torn into two worlds — &quot;inside school&quot; and &quot;outside school.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Entry approval is predation</strong>: who can enroll, who can take high-tier courses, approval power is in the academy, ultimately in Tang Luo. Turning &quot;can one cultivate&quot; into &quot;can one be selected&quot; is downgrading a natural right to an approval qualification</li><li><strong>Curriculum layering is predation</strong>: high-tier courses only offered to &quot;whom Tang Luo fancies&quot; has exactly the same structure as aristocratic families back then only transmitting to &quot;family descendants,&quot; only the selection standard changed from bloodline to &quot;principal&#39;s eye favor&quot;</li><li><strong>Knowledge single-point is predation</strong>: cultivation orthodoxy exists only here, equivalent to declaring all other learning paths &quot;non-orthodox&quot; — this is knowledge monopoly&#39;s school form</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo is the <strong>enlightened predator</strong>. His original intention in founding the academy was supremely good, but the &quot;single orthodox academy&quot; form itself is just old monopoly with a new sign. What he lacks is breaking the academy into a network — a cross-plane mentor network, letting knowledge be everywhere rather than elites gathered in one place.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Wushuang Academy</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sole orthodoxy, centralized campus</td><td>Cross-plane mentor network, distributed teaching, any corner can enroll</td></tr><tr><td>Selection system, limited quotas</td><td>Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System, Education Guarantee Law backstop, no &quot;can&#39;t get in so no road&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>Courses layered by principal&#39;s eye</td><td>Symbiotic Education System layered by talent and progress, but every tier fully open, queryable, audit-able</td></tr><tr><td>Teachers concentrated on famous masters</td><td>All courses uploaded to Alaya Network, billions of students and billions of mentors paired in real time</td></tr><tr><td>Principal leaves, tea cools</td><td>Education written into constitution, curriculum standards adjudicated by Symbiotic Court, not depending on any famous master</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: turn &quot;one academy&quot; into &quot;one network.&quot; The wall is torn down, do not build it back.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Wushuang Academy&#39;s admission model and off-campus resource vacuum belt</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A single-academy system; Group B injects cross-plane mentor network</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: number of off-campus evil cultivators within a hundred years, success rate of failures, overall cultivation population growth</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B overall success rate several times Group A, evil-cultivator incidents approach zero — proving &quot;concentrating elites&quot; is inferior to &quot;distributed universal benefit&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. &quot;Protagonist founds a badass academy&quot; is this type of world-view&#39;s standard, logically self-consistent</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Typical risk: late academy scale inflates to the point of self-inconsistency — from &quot;one academy&quot; to &quot;countless academies under heaven,&quot; the early &quot;sole orthodoxy&quot; setting is quietly diluted; or to create conflict, temporarily &quot;a traitor appears in the academy / a teacher turns dark,&quot; plot needs override school rules</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high. The academy&#39;s soul is Tang Luo himself, institutions are only his extension</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: centralized schooling causes triple waste of travel, screening, and failure</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: entry approval power downgrades a natural right to an approval qualification</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo tore down aristocratic families&#39; walls, but built a new building on the original site</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the academy should be cross-racial, cross-plane, covering 99% of beings</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: distributed networks match multiverse scale</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Wushuang Academy is a monument to Tang Luo&#39;s good will, and also a monument to Tang Luo&#39;s limits. The monument tells later generations what he broke; the memorial tells later generations what he did not break — the word &quot;sole&quot; itself is a wall.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./37-共生教育体系.html">37-Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./43-教育保障法.html">43-Education Guarantee Law</a> · <a href="./08-人人有路保障体系.html">08-Everyone-Has-a-Road Guarantee System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=t(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
